    "name": "IKeyedModel<...> keyed-model contract",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "A keyed model at arity N (N = 1, 2, 3, or 4) exposes a read-only Key whose type is ShardKey<T1, …, TN>. Each generic type argument T1…TN must implement IComparable; the Key property's ShardKey type preserves the same ordered generic argument sequence and arity."
